            "ImageDescription": {
              "value": "Preparing and grilling seekh kebabs at Salim's curry takeaway and restaurant in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turnpike_Lane,_Haringey\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Turnpike Lane, Haringey\">Turnpike Lane</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/London_Borough_of_Haringey\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:London Borough of Haringey\">Haringey</a>, London, England. The person depicted was willing and gave permission to be photographed, and understood that the image would be uploaded to Wikimedia. He may, however, require a personality rights waiver for follow-on use of the image, or parts of the image.<br><b>A recipe</b>: hand blend into minced lamb a mix of fresh green chilli, fresh garlic, fresh coriander leaves, and fresh ginger, all finely chopped. Hand blend in a seasoning of salt and cumin powder and form into sausage lengths or patties. Grill, or fry in a small amount of oil. Minced chicken is an alternative.<br><b>Camera</b>: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samsung_Galaxy_S7\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Samsung Galaxy S7\">Samsung Galaxy S7 Edge</a>.<br><b>Software</b>: JPEG file lens-corrected, optimized and converted with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DxO_PhotoLab\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:DxO PhotoLab\">DxO PhotoLab 2 Elite</a>, and further optimized with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adobe_Photoshop#CS2\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Adobe Photoshop\">Adobe Photoshop CS2</a>.",
